WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.367
GS4 tells you exactly which

2
00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:04.617
values it is looking for.

3
00:00:04.617 --> 00:00:06.936
They're written into the syllabus.

4
00:00:07.274 --> 00:00:09.177
Integrity, impartiality,

5
00:00:09.177 --> 00:00:11.336
non-partisanship. Objectivity,

6
00:00:11.336 --> 00:00:13.842
and dedication to public service.

7
00:00:13.842 --> 00:00:14.618
And empathy,

8
00:00:14.618 --> 00:00:16.595
tolerance and compassion towards the

9
00:00:16.595 --> 00:00:18.008
weaker sections.

10
00:00:18.346 --> 00:00:20.565
Impartiality means being fair to

11
00:00:20.565 --> 00:00:21.843
every citizen.

12
00:00:21.843 --> 00:00:24.483
Non-partisanship means staying neutral between

13
00:00:24.483 --> 00:00:26.851
parties, whoever is in power.

14
00:00:27.529 --> 00:00:29.612
Don't just name a value.

15
00:00:29.612 --> 00:00:30.779
Show what it looks like

16
00:00:30.779 --> 00:00:31.571
in a decision,

17
00:00:31.571 --> 00:00:32.747
in one line.

18
00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:34.243
Your turn.

19
00:00:34.243 --> 00:00:36.146
Which value is this?
